WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.158
Profile now gathers your level, your XP and your settings in one place.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.151
Your level sits beside your name, with an XP bar. Under it: the XP to the next

00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:17.988
level, your rides, kilometres and streak.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.810
A new rider starts at level one, with no rides and no kilometres yet.

00:00:33.552 --> 00:00:37.767
Settings lists your bike and its state, ride settings and your custom workout,

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:39.905
before your name and your account.

00:00:46.457 --> 00:00:50.409
With no bike paired, the row says so and takes you to Connect Bike.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.114
From a phone to a laptop: one column, then two, with Settings beside.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.612
What the tests prove: the right numbers for every rider, and every row in its place.

00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:24.612
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:24.957 --> 00:01:29.469
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:29.469 --> 00:01:31.140
every hill and interval.

00:01:31.485 --> 00:01:36.663
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:42.111
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:42.111 --> 00:01:45.101
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:45.446 --> 00:01:47.939
A custom workout lives under Profile.
